        "impact": {
          "en": "The reinstatement of US open-weight AI models by Meta offers accessible resources for AI development, potentially stimulating innovation. The rapid user adoption of the Muse app for practical uses like shopping demonstrates a significant market for consumer-oriented AI tools.",
