        "title": {
          "en": "AI Agents Connect with Reverse Engineering Tools for Binary Analysis",
          "zh": "AI智能体与逆向工程工具连接，助力二进制分析"
        },
        "tl_dr": {
          "en": "The open-source Reverse Engineer Anything (REA) project has integrated AI coding agents like Claude Code and Codex with reverse-engineering tools such as Ghidra, Hopper, and IDA, facilitating binary analysis.",
          "zh": "开源项目Reverse Engineer Anything (REA) 已将Claude Code和Codex等AI编程智能体与Ghidra、Hopper和IDA等逆向工程工具集成，以促进二进制分析。"
        },
        "key_takeaways": {
          "en": [
            "Reverse Engineer Anything (REA) is an open-source project designed for binary analysis.",
            "The project has garnered over 200K GitHub stars.",
            "REA connects AI coding agents including Claude Code and Codex to reverse-engineering tools like Ghidra, Hopper, and IDA, enabling developers to inspect compiled binaries, trace function calls, and investigate feature implementations."
          ],
          "zh": [
            "Reverse Engineer Anything (REA) 是一个用于二进制分析的开源项目。",
            "该项目在GitHub上获得了超过20万颗星。",
            "REA将Claude Code和Codex等AI编程智能体与Ghidra、Hopper和IDA等逆向工程工具连接起来，使开发人员能够检查编译后的二进制文件、追踪函数调用并调查功能实现。"
          ]
        },
        "impact": {
          "en": "This integration extends the application of AI agents into the complex domain of binary analysis, providing developers with enhanced capabilities to inspect compiled software and investigate specific implementations.",
          "zh": "此次集成将AI智能体的应用扩展到复杂的二进制分析领域，为开发人员提供了增强的能力，以检查编译后的软件并调查具体实现。"
        },
        "source": "InfoQ (AI/ML)",
        "link": "https://www.infoq.com/news/2026/10/reverse-engineer-anything/?utm_campaign=infoq_content&utm_source=infoq&utm_medium=feed&utm_term=AI%2C+ML+%26+Data+Engineering-news"
